OL,3,GNEWSAFarm 'barricades' its gates after
OL,4,Asuspected fly-tip
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer said he will have to pay about
OL,7,F#1,500 to dispose of about 30 tonnes of
OL,8,Fprocessed waste that has been
OL,9,Ffly-tipped on his land.
OL,11,FPeter Sharpley farms 1,200 acres of
OL,12,Fland between Water Newton, near
OL,13,FPeterborough, and Stamford, in
OL,14,FLincolnshire, with most of it running
OL,15,Fbeside the A1.
OL,17,FHe said he had put heavy farm equipment
OL,18,Facross entrances to fields in an effort
OL,19,Fto prevent it from happening again.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
